{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"zhangle-e-o029b","title":"张郃惧郭图谮归曹操","accounts":[{"id":"zhangle-e-o029b-account","label":"《张乐于张徐传第十七》正文","text":"张郃惧郭图谮归曹操","evidence":["zhangle-e-o029b-q"]},{"id":"zhangle-a-p007-judgment","label":"裴松之按","text":"裴松之指出本传张郃归降在军溃后的叙法，与武纪及袁绍传先降后溃不同。","evidence":["zhangle-q-p007-judgment"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wudi-p0183","role":"归降","evidence":["zhangle-e-o029b-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0174","role":"谮毁","evidence":["zhangle-e-o029b-q"]},{"person":"cao-cao","role":"接纳","evidence":["zhangle-e-o029b-q"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"官渡之战时","precision":"undated","basis":"保留本条时间表达，不据相邻段落自动补年。","evidence":["zhangle-e-o029b-q"]},"ordering_evidence":"zhangle-e-o029b-q","source_order":[17,102,"O029b"],"order":3542}],"persons":[{"id":"cao-cao","name":"曹操","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wudi-p0174","name":"郭图","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wudi-p0183","name":"张郃","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"zhangle-e-o029b-q","section":"chapter-017","block":"b-a4ccf00fcd84c9fc6e1a","layer":"original","quote":"太祖果破琼等，绍军溃。图惭，又更谮郃曰：“郃快军败〖2〗，出言不逊。”郃惧，乃归太祖。﹝二﹞太祖得郃甚喜，谓曰：“昔子胥不早悟〖3〗，自使身危；岂若微子去殷、韩信归汉邪！”","section_title":"张乐于张徐传第十七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0039.xhtml","index":101,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":153,"end":239,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhangle-q-p007-judgment","section":"chapter-017","block":"b-cfe26b6568d95feca7e6","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝二﹞臣松之按《武纪》及《袁绍传》，并云：袁绍使张郃、高览攻太祖营，郃等闻淳于琼破，遂来降，绍众于是大溃。是则缘郃等降，而后绍军坏也。至如此传，为绍军先溃，惧郭图之谮，然后归太祖：为参错不同矣。","attribution":"裴松之按","section_title":"张乐于张徐传第十七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0039.xhtml","index":118,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-35bb4026c88951933765","start":0,"end":97,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
